#: scenario4:scenario4_D8C730E6_D220_4BD2_B4DB_B03613FE9E14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 878496f5f7d0b3a605fd256e7d11cb37f85edb89e21b46ef294ada64ffe51e84
#. default-sha256: 5e3cf5bb5a0a6086ae1d625be8b1c069f1d1d38af962964a44cac39049b53f26
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D8C730E6_D220_4BD2_B4DB_B03613FE9E14"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫And that marked the true beginning of their quiet days together in "
"the dark mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫暗闇の屋敷での、⟪k:23⟫穏やかな生活。⟪k:24⟫それは、⟪k:25⟫今度こそ始ま"
"りを見せました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F085551F_4068_4559_A67F_4A1C65501FE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4516702c06f1f2451b3e99005567ca883aa78f27b00046b8ca0bde1ed8f129a5
#. default-sha256: d59a1bf548e57f6cfe760b6be65e4f0a53034b8d3577d9a5bbe085324876e9b6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F085551F_4068_4559_A67F_4A1C65501FE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They acknowledged and accepted each other’s presence, no longer isolating themselves, but "
"actively, regularly conversing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫お互いの存在を認め、⟪k:1⟫離ればなれではなく、⟪k:2⟫顔を向け合って言葉を交わす。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_934438FF_AB82_4D4C_96E2_98AD5581A9ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 253c82c13579260f749e969c5d7b444bb7e8da0998d1738db1da34b9265faf55
#. default-sha256: 81645dd2aec350ac8d889fbad19770fbca6d065f64db00de21ad05ac5a966672
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_934438FF_AB82_4D4C_96E2_98AD5581A9ED"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As mundane as it might seem, it was something they had been unable to attain until then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そんな、⟪k:1⟫当たり前のようでいながら、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫二人が今まで得られなかった日々……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F1DB41FD_7525_49AD_9B08_BE017AF4B59C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c87112e5dff1ed87ec553f953de26925b6d1ebd46dc65a73234f248457aadce
#. default-sha256: 03e7c1407d6803667b976c7203d79a06d49d43845b8b096a598264b570dc45f9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F1DB41FD_7525_49AD_9B08_BE017AF4B59C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, they were still somewhat fumbling around in the dark with one another, drawing "
"closer and pushing away again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫二人の心の距離感は、⟪k:1⟫近付いたかと思えば遠ざかるような、⟪k:2⟫ぎこちないものでした。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_8FEAAD6E_DEF7_4BF9_983B_A2DB5D1404F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23a52170cf90b8e9652536cb64b78eba164026752b26cfcbc90fac41f379d09a
#. default-sha256: f07d11042730a2be98faefd5ef01446c9808dd624acb0d48ee3176a9823423ce
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8FEAAD6E_DEF7_4BF9_983B_A2DB5D1404F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel, in his own ungraceful way, was beginning to open himself up to the things she said,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それでも、⟪k:1⟫ミシェルは不器用ながらに彼女の言葉を受け止め始めましたし――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_26C4B32C_F056_4E69_A1BF_1C2B822B551A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f299b30271a2d2f9c11d2203d6d426e3b717def84a42adaae5703359963d8542
#. default-sha256: ebb2e8aaf6b8a5af63e68e5d30f2ca5aff570c47eb2b164ea9d2451bd530538a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_26C4B32C_F056_4E69_A1BF_1C2B822B551A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and the White-Haired Girl was beginning to smile with greater frequency."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫白い髪の娘も、⟪k:1⟫笑う回数が増えていきました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0E8068CF_1E52_4198_89D8_E1C794B849A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a736e12d6ab7c78936a191e7fa79774cf4bd9aa4bebb1e292781461a336ecd8e
#. default-sha256: 1e54546fe7e91502b53f5172325ea08eb51605483ae98520f68fc2cdf176e746
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0E8068CF_1E52_4198_89D8_E1C794B849A0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They had taken to dining together, and her wish of learning to read was being granted."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫食事も共にとるようになりましたし、⟪k:1⟫いつだか彼女が望んだ「文字を教えてもらうこと」も叶いま"
"したわ。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_54D32434_00B1_47B9_BD97_C3623016EE94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12ba59f96a261ea6ffb6a2dc0c728853d21a7ab9eb599a775bd07020ead8fc8d
#. default-sha256: ccb0b06e9d0c08747f14ba2b7d78d128ca00a0f62e1537064f22ce64789c0600
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54D32434_00B1_47B9_BD97_C3623016EE94"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He taught her in the feeble light of a candle placed upon the table, the two sitting across "
"from one another."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫机を囲んで、⟪k:1⟫頼りない蝋燭の灯りの下――彼女は文字の読み方を知っていきました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FD793E1F_F6F9_441C_B905_B179018226C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 449292161ffb1739cdd05e72fd8e6e687b480cb3d43ead0f695d3cf1b91a6cd4
#. default-sha256: a2a744d481240784e2b81ce45817bb1397c4ba4453fb05bc99d1bb7b97fc17c0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FD793E1F_F6F9_441C_B905_B179018226C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though Michel seemed to be well educated, he had not been instructed in the art of teaching, "
"so he found the process quite grueling."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ミシェルは学がある青年のようですが、⟪k:1⟫人に物を教えるのは不得手だったようで、⟪k:2⟫それはそ"
"れは中々に難儀する作業でした。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_397AB7EF_2D6D_4E70_AFC4_AA1C02627DB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71ce7e38c98aa71ec3a2c879ecebf7d45dbadf7b421ae273d5d9174d8eb8ee67
#. default-sha256: 476da90dd2e2fee5f6f4d7cada1e002a1e5999c34f622f65964ff7a4048cd9d7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_397AB7EF_2D6D_4E70_AFC4_AA1C02627DB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But to the White-Haired Girl, the longer it took the better;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫her primary objective "
"was, after all, to spend time with him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれど、⟪k:1⟫時間はかかればかかるほど良いのです。⟪k:2⟫だって……彼女の何よりの目的は、⟪k:3⟫一緒"
"にいること、⟪k:4⟫でしたから。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_169BCDD3_EA39_4040_91FA_8DEA88A1E072
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3670dc1eb35cf852d37e2d2b120602cc36028c9b1a46880ada3b2070c15d8089
#. default-sha256: 1fe09d2832af954f3bbaacb7d6333e5913556d3f5fde6cf06507fdb178d195f8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_169BCDD3_EA39_4040_91FA_8DEA88A1E072"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The days passed,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫やがて、⟪k:1⟫二人の日々は過ぎていき――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_864C6DC9_F3F0_4202_9C3D_51E1AA4616BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1f3e5cd3db714a615152a14850ca10b60208220cccec6da50d42aae080ca986
#. default-sha256: b36f848aaf2b8616e6fee3cd7d88cff287cc0ca85ffdafb594ceb0d0a7d3b4e0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_864C6DC9_F3F0_4202_9C3D_51E1AA4616BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and eventually, she reached the point where her comprehension was adequate enough without "
"assistance. ⟪k:1⟫Her next request, then, was for them to read through a book together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼女はひとりでも不自由しない程度には、⟪k:1⟫読みが達者になりました。⟪k:2⟫けれど今度は、⟪k:3⟫"
"「一緒に本を読むこと」をお願いしたのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_BA67D6B6_3E00_47E2_B154_E49365D0681C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93ed5c84e5e3dbad3db85b8f95443679c3e612b345b7cf9470136d5e36910e58
#. default-sha256: 719856d0dcac9f19431566edd9b3bcf7f806da41f76be888a71604ff35f5da25
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BA67D6B6_3E00_47E2_B154_E49365D0681C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Have you read every book in the library?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫\t⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ここにある本は、⟪k:5⟫すべて目を通されたのですか？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7DAB50FB_8948_45A9_923F_F1699154B38F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f6bcf51222e18e6d41a8345f4c2ca3ef507031cf906b754553fe014503a8df8
#. default-sha256: 82f7dfc004ab1d4a35648a6b0d1125766fa668370f5277119d2de890b15a1905
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7DAB50FB_8948_45A9_923F_F1699154B38F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫No... ⟪k:5⟫I stopped looking at them after a while."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫いや……、⟪k:5⟫途中から読むのをやめてしまいました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_07BD7C42_2024_42BF_A7AC_3D6680ADB294
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e25c5435dceab0d2f4b05717595658f2d0ca67486a7d8cf176a65e8d884ea7d
#. default-sha256: df85cadf81478a72ae749ded115b07e6199d7c93d6134cf29f1f15da5d0635cb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_07BD7C42_2024_42BF_A7AC_3D6680ADB294"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Most everything I’m sent is dull, uninformative dreck.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The diary of a lord... "
"⟪k:4⟫Foolish make-believe tales..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫送られてくるのは、⟪k:2⟫知識の糧にもならないつまらないものばかりです。⟪k:3⟫領主の残した日"
"記だとか、⟪k:4⟫あるいはくだらない空想の物語……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_8D35450D_B142_480E_A9F5_804E8D21EB2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1fe03089560ec0eff8b87fe7151418f331bca8232f53094279657ad9c8aef53
#. default-sha256: 5e86f5cca04cd9c9ef2594b5ba91229a0b93a816ef3682722dce44ddd08316a0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8D35450D_B142_480E_A9F5_804E8D21EB2F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You’re not fond of fiction, I take it?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫物語は、⟪k:1⟫あまりお好きじゃないんですね……？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_AE1BC5CF_BE0C_42C0_8420_E000E3D78D5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed92e2c48e0526b000ee8f56f1195093da922f77d1ab2ec42580f7ba505b1689
#. default-sha256: 85b7171a28d092ca480fc66a2ab28f1caee41f23dd053478778f348416469a18
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AE1BC5CF_BE0C_42C0_8420_E000E3D78D5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What value is there in the lies and fantasies of another?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫嘘で固められた誰かの空想物に、⟪k:1⟫なんの価値があるというのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_5D9DCB1D_9C9E_4905_8D6B_3C0E3265D28F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88def0983d8ee39e3db963b761579339e8c4b745420086194e1bac34cb30ad65
#. default-sha256: 142418bbd04ac77cae23b85477b0d350e3e0c397fafe9788d28a68074e4f14c3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5D9DCB1D_9C9E_4905_8D6B_3C0E3265D28F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Stories... ⟪k:1⟫can be invigorating.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Tales of adventure can take you places you "
"could never go."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫でも……、⟪k:1⟫お話は、⟪k:2⟫時に心を潤してくれませんか？　⟪k:3⟫冒険譚は、⟪k:4⟫自分では行けな"
"かった土地に思いをはせることが出来ます。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_79A4C059_3588_4A67_84DB_1DAE20CFEF5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52dd571a734d248c9d5abe793b74cc204951f91e7c1e27dab87a7efb0a61d2c7
#. default-sha256: 747278899c45d932018e871b88c7f06f578f91ba0fb1a779c2f299d9ca3b886a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_79A4C059_3588_4A67_84DB_1DAE20CFEF5B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Legends of heroes, folklore, stories of otherworldly phenomena.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They can be "
"terrifying, and they can be exhilarating."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫英雄の伝説も、⟪k:1⟫神様の伝承も、⟪k:2⟫それからこの世ならざる現象を語る物語も――時に恐ろしくさ"
"せ、⟪k:3⟫時に胸を躍らせます。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E64A5DAE_C4BE_41D7_96DE_D6DB8B7054E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ade55b44209c4e92ace1a79400faf82658c6b34185541871ecd5eda63c49f10
#. default-sha256: d482d478d4b701cd185af3b56365a0c80f17816c976e7df485ed0f5e2d666abc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E64A5DAE_C4BE_41D7_96DE_D6DB8B7054E0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They may not be real, but they give you a little glimpse into the author’s heart—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"let you feel like you’re seeing the same thing they saw."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫たとえそれが、⟪k:1⟫偽りであっても。⟪k:2⟫作者の心に触れられたような、⟪k:3⟫その光景を私も一緒に"
"見たような……そんな気持ちになるから。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0558A8F4_B267_478E_88CC_3059E51F9061
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2766144352d9a673c59a71ec1dd9bc1c753264da03cac50532f548bc2019c836
#. default-sha256: d8d029382da60620cd70a6703d9ea5aa8a2537f5a6393ec1f0d27fdcdffdebd9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0558A8F4_B267_478E_88CC_3059E51F9061"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...You are a very empathetic girl.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Fiction inspires nothing of the sort in me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………貴女は、⟪k:1⟫感受性が豊かなんだ。⟪k:2⟫私には、⟪k:3⟫とてもそうは思えない。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_8F0A27F9_A8FB_4812_A0BB_03F19731376B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c006a46941e875ad960adbf4af376956d8cffc6e882337ea52395f4452bb93c4
#. default-sha256: 38b0ee7a93f1cdeded9976146cdcb6c8fa5268e906123b6041093d2f3439566c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8F0A27F9_A8FB_4812_A0BB_03F19731376B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……でも……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_1EB8D266_8768_4E89_94AE_0D39579A75FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8392de2669bc5357d41273f89ef01e48894a5805f980f74a2465a918677f64b0
#. default-sha256: a8e72efeb25be6f4eae66670f46eda0fb7cce36fb9631b104603b290cab9d233
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1EB8D266_8768_4E89_94AE_0D39579A75FE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F934972B_8D87_4A6F_9D42_88AA60C16AD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e446e0e30501c32da7acdd3e77b5471f04b930a50984cd868d877d30c94dbcff
#. default-sha256: a1f15f1eb625178c033d238d3e50c3d723ece83c47d02d671cfb39c242001a35
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F934972B_8D87_4A6F_9D42_88AA60C16AD6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perhaps long ago... ⟪k:1⟫it may have been able to,⟪k:2⟫though I can no longer remember what "
"it feels like."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私も、⟪k:1⟫かつては……そのように心を動かしたのかもしれない。⟪k:2⟫もう、⟪k:3⟫思い出せなくなって"
"しまったが……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B35B874F_18F8_4245_9D80_D44806C2377C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecced753772dd7702306509100c6e5388b6d253c82e972504393d6af5d2a557a
#. default-sha256: b3e5c5917fb5b333714f27dadf595c46b9ae44521f21b656bef7e4c1c28739c6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B35B874F_18F8_4245_9D80_D44806C2377C"
