"⟪k:0⟫The mansion has an observation tower.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Or, I suppose, what ⟪k:3⟫used to be⟪k:4⟫ an "
"observation tower.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫At any rate, it is quite a tall structure."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫この屋敷には、⟪k:1⟫物見の塔が存在している。⟪k:2⟫物見の塔であったもの……というべきかもしれませ"
"ん。⟪k:3⟫しかし、⟪k:4⟫随分と高いものです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_232507DC_CB0E_4DFE_B4F0_5F49E6A1E001
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d722935146fed1a61bf1edafee5268bf1df1d0651ce67b2d0c9c1d734dfc5dea
#. default-sha256: 8f5d866c6e6047a5a34401c1660446c19eb031f4af30504aad9daba06ccdee1f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_232507DC_CB0E_4DFE_B4F0_5F49E6A1E001"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is the house where the witch was supposedly born.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A tower reaching for the "
"heavens seems like the perfect place to find her... ⟪k:3⟫if she really is here."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫魔女が産まれた館と噂され、⟪k:1⟫そしてその館に残された天への道……。⟪k:2⟫遭遇するには、⟪k:3⟫うっ"
"てつけでしょう。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_1C2A081C_D09A_481C_876E_597B904881E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 494db49291288c209fb67abfa418033b42b9e05f877c937601962095dabe1418
#. default-sha256: 83878591ba0cefca491a81f2ad9b72b83e4d9b26831dba3bd7e082cbc42db4e1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1C2A081C_D09A_481C_876E_597B904881E8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, yes... ⟪k:1⟫I remember seeing a rather tall structure as I first approached the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そういえば、⟪k:1⟫ここに来る時に……塔らしき建物を見ました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_BB2A21FE_8948_4AC0_9B8F_DF25E0651F50
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ad49ccad63629f1e6513bb30bcff2cfdfa774f5be2423db80484532f1fb5a82
#. default-sha256: b39fe7f9f12caac09ef788f446ac18b1646cb452797aefef6339773d63efe549
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BB2A21FE_8948_4AC0_9B8F_DF25E0651F50"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Would you like to see it?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……行ってみますか。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D778D0C_990F_426B_A394_D97893122DB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c6114c3d8c60bb6f4677c13b37aba7031f7061831d6f8dcc276474a056b852f
#. default-sha256: 8ac9eb4d778ad2c397e9a7d3da6ba5cb322ccee5200ce8a35a07e836eb9eaccc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D778D0C_990F_426B_A394_D97893122DB0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of course. ⟪k:1⟫Please, lead the way."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫はい。⟪k:1⟫連れていって……もらえますか？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_71CF4F07_DA57_42DD_A8DA_1E4989D87721
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c075400eed086410321304c9739af644844b7f73cabf832e3573c5db668ba73
#. default-sha256: 81e24312805399c6aaa172d627fc40c23a1580936b2795a8b801865db7b3c9c7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_71CF4F07_DA57_42DD_A8DA_1E4989D87721"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The two of them left the library and made their way to the room with the stained-glass "
"window. ⟪k:1⟫At the far end of that room were the stairs to the observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫二人は書庫を後にし、⟪k:1⟫ステンドグラスの間へと向かいました。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫物見の塔へ続く階段は、"
"⟪k:4⟫その脇にあります。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_9264DB10_FCB0_4EAF_A93C_A9CD85A78D3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 088021f0eb82d53d78de9e9d65eb5b2c9ab169e21e2472c7a15f1defd4456cff
#. default-sha256: d34e770f8100e1e62471cee50538bb05c8111710941feb64baef0518143bcac8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9264DB10_FCB0_4EAF_A93C_A9CD85A78D3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The tale of the witch had piqued the White-Haired Girl’s interest, inspiring her to put "
"herself forward to satisfy that curiosity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫きっと彼女にとっては、⟪k:1⟫好奇心、⟪k:2⟫興味……あるいは、⟪k:3⟫ちょっとした冒険だったのかもしれ"
"ません。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_57214629_ED20_4FA1_88F5_3167DDEF3496
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c669919ffa32fac18fdb78b68f860a6ef48c05819e1c67150e345f512d19168
#. default-sha256: 8e24bd92da2c193f8a559df1d11c1aa1bb9bc2fdc3a639664023b4dcb4369890
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_57214629_ED20_4FA1_88F5_3167DDEF3496"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had, after all, been accused of being a witch herself, so she undoubtedly felt an "
"affinity to the legend."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫自分自身も、⟪k:1⟫魔女としていわれのない疑いをかけられた身です。⟪k:2⟫彼女にとっては、⟪k:3⟫他人"
"事には思えなかったのでしょうね。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_4ADAC2C0_C8CF_4270_BF39_562E6746F0AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c846ec1af95f71cfc1a22fcbea8050b4415398112e3e7ccf71d594ffa414d72b
#. default-sha256: 0d5715940d3e55abf9a5e773919ea371687150b2e11a3bd6100c3610e137eed8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_4ADAC2C0_C8CF_4270_BF39_562E6746F0AF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What a sweet girl she was.⟪k:1⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫なんと優しいことでしょうか……。⟪k:1⟫"

#: scenario4:scenario4_49AB0168_0BFF_4FA2_8EE8_7FD96A89692B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68aafd1b25ad10a2e470a85cc66a38a98d6837a6d984a4044202f0da8f98c099
#. default-sha256: 4e428b52aae40bbc0ce425f76f630e98c819fa3f994c2f84c8cd3db287993b90
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_49AB0168_0BFF_4FA2_8EE8_7FD96A89692B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With Michel in the lead, the two climbed a long, long spiral staircase. ⟪k:1⟫There were many "
"more stairs than the White-Haired Girl had anticipated, and she soon found herself short of "
"breath."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫長い長いらせん階段を、⟪k:1⟫ミシェルの先導のもと、⟪k:2⟫上っていきました。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫予想してい"
"た以上の段数に、⟪k:5⟫娘は少し、⟪k:6⟫息が上がっていましたわ。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_BFE8A313_D7D2_46CD_9BF9_FB338F656C81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75d8cccde9469ba48ab753e67d9a9b5c0666e06e8c62f4614bc0cc939f483b2b
#. default-sha256: fb84a3f88663bff7b324d7c47c2fbb0454aeaf75b474b331134207aa26ed53d0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BFE8A313_D7D2_46CD_9BF9_FB338F656C81"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Rectangular windows were carved out of the stone in regular intervals.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Peering "
"through one of them, she could see a village in the distance.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A pleasantly cool, high-"
"altitude breeze brushed across her face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫途中には壁をくり抜いた窓があって、⟪k:1⟫遠くに村の集落が見えます。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫そこから吹き込む上"
"空の風が、⟪k:4⟫彼女の頬を心地よく撫でていきました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_270F6A86_8C3F_43D8_84F0_27CEBECB8C40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1c600ec901ad887d2860e9431c99f1d9ed79d0e377f66800cc0a9efc1c0265b
#. default-sha256: d04c4148571fd4d4edd21033b6212c2aecbf95c5cb1a3813f936fd64116c82e7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_270F6A86_8C3F_43D8_84F0_27CEBECB8C40"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫After much climbing, they finally arrived at the top, where a door made of "
"partially rotted wood stood. ⟪k:3⟫Michel pulled open the door,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫やがて最上階へとたどり着き、⟪k:3⟫ミシェルは腐りかけた小さな扉を開きました。⟪k:4⟫そ"
"こにあったのは――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_49F2455F_56FD_480D_9FBD_536B2CAB6D6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 297c0badccc4d43b568cf46b12812519efa98390e3fd31ce25000a24c2ded10d
#. default-sha256: 189e91ddd776a85dd0d23b8f89a49baddb738d68e5f2795e214082a9937464dc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_49F2455F_56FD_480D_9FBD_536B2CAB6D6E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫revealing a small room with no windows or doors in sight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫閉ざされた、⟪k:1⟫ただただ小さな一室でございました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2450C494_16D3_472C_ABAC_4FB3A8B26FAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1125be4e57c54078d39cab119113290f25ba900ef45a295971474dc2de23a098
#. default-sha256: 892f388d790157b214b55e48cf7ff2fcb5004249b0e9f50a552cc9183af6e44f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2450C494_16D3_472C_ABAC_4FB3A8B26FAA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This is... ⟪k:3⟫the top of the tower?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ここが……、⟪k:3⟫最上階、⟪k:4⟫なんですか？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_469ACD43_F360_4D40_9337_C7C39BAAA1C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7eecca6a15f51dfbfdeb203a4c22b4aeeed684894f1e8609f1c42d066976ea4d
#. default-sha256: 0939595f961289ec2ca2d14696f9d5ec4ff9f8308525e05c0e126fda8fc929e8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_469ACD43_F360_4D40_9337_C7C39BAAA1C0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite it being called an “observation” tower,⟪k:1⟫you could hardly observe anything from "
"there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“物見”の塔と名付けられているのに、⟪k:1⟫これでは何も見えないではありませんか。⟪k:2⟫なんとも、"
"⟪k:3⟫名前ばかりな場でございます。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_91F67F05_9FD7_4CCA_BE9A_2FB93429678E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f7b3834b2c2ed1b9d47b83e2953a9bedb0df7907b4bfa3ab263f06ccfb79916
#. default-sha256: 6fb1467283f9cb25ddd679a648041c0ebfd146810bd2b839ae88075d551b06c0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_91F67F05_9FD7_4CCA_BE9A_2FB93429678E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her face contorted in confusion, the White-Haired Girl threw her gaze about the room. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Glancing up, she saw only a darkened ceiling—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫娘は不思議そうな顔をして、⟪k:1⟫ぐるりと見渡しました。⟪k:2⟫天井を見上げても青空など目に入りま"
"せん。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_EE08DDC7_DBCC_4473_8EE1_206FC8B7867A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 094c5e199e5b6a47db0cbcf4d87b661c808263813a30677eb4334d46514fea4d
#. default-sha256: 946b3d37ab3384b10ea7c97a65d4bb19d136b2fab28eb1807b5c169a7cca0e1e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EE08DDC7_DBCC_4473_8EE1_206FC8B7867A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and, slightly below it, a single small window through which shone a little ray of light."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しかし、⟪k:1⟫そこでひときわ明るく、⟪k:2⟫光源を集めるものを見つけました。⟪k:3⟫そう、⟪k:4⟫天井"
"に近いところにひとつの窓があり、⟪k:5⟫そこから光が注いでくるのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_EC304EF2_BDBB_4265_B4C3_F2B09A7FAB33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02d8ba418c4f127d42fd45d1a1cf9f1f8ab49288637be228b9ddcb79f5dc6fbb
#. default-sha256: abe01a21b9fd6b7be63c7f3562971c0febf936e58d1f344e1b99cb96aea08e49
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EC304EF2_BDBB_4265_B4C3_F2B09A7FAB33"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The beam cleaved through the darkness like the sharpened blade of a beautiful sword."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫暗がりに差し込む一条の光は、⟪k:1⟫研ぎ澄まされた刃のように美しく見えました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_87F10E3A_D125_40FE_B5DE_6D19AF1ACCB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e4bb7db0777643937a5a935fc9df587e919bbd7280bd90b44edbfb18b211a12
#. default-sha256: bde1e8dc8ae5c9420214abddb447beccd32285ab8687f6f7b36dc09c588a0c73
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_87F10E3A_D125_40FE_B5DE_6D19AF1ACCB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The darkness draped over the rest of the room only served to make more impressive that "
"solitary ray of light."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫周囲が暗闇に包まれているからこそ、⟪k:1⟫その光の帯はひときわ鮮やかに映るのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_D72BA3A5_89B0_4D14_AC35_7B775885F7FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17343bdc165254a714ae789db84586deeaebf802e5a48a5394541c85d5df3d66
#. default-sha256: 558b51e33c20357bb58d5d7bcfa7c8d5e5b2281f43ebf83f4d922b2b875adced
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D72BA3A5_89B0_4D14_AC35_7B775885F7FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It had a magical, fairy-tale quality to it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫幻想的――とも、⟪k:1⟫言えるかもしれません。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_1E541513_5969_453E_8B6E_BABD41A78AAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 258264f46dfd892f5a2391de314efd23a118296d2a5592d6d286932e234a8194
#. default-sha256: cb52622cb031a57fc193b19016b6f65ab732bbbb02b2a644ff1482cb3a454661
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1E541513_5969_453E_8B6E_BABD41A78AAF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As if being pulled in by it, she drew toward the light."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女は、⟪k:1⟫吸い寄せられるように、⟪k:2⟫その光のもとへと向かいました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_54096ADB_53CA_44CA_990D_3DC843B79FC4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecec423119327364c4ac248dc2dfd8a79270e38bbff281b73182e8f7f3f309fc
#. default-sha256: e83584f5d78984e13525eca30ab18ab4ff3fdb0898d057ffa47b176e1bb7e66f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54096ADB_53CA_44CA_990D_3DC843B79FC4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I suspect there was once a large window in this room.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If you look closely, you can "
"see seams in the stone of the wall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫かつては、⟪k:1⟫周囲に大きな窓が作られていたのだと思います。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫この石壁の繋ぎ目を見てく"
"ださい。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B7DE50E3_2E21_43BD_9075_6A1080080B63
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8b0ef338a1e2a41819aed0ecbd38fb76c82ded532cc95245bd01330beecd421
#. default-sha256: 934ddc3eddebfd482c26767ffa71ccabf89a84a66cce13e938c5380d126e371b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B7DE50E3_2E21_43BD_9075_6A1080080B63"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The color of the stone differs slightly on either side of the seams.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I presume "
"something caused them to seal off the window⟪k:3⟫after it was built."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫色合いが異なっているでしょう。⟪k:1⟫恐らく、⟪k:2⟫何らかの事情があって……窓を塞いだのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A1A2EF23_130D_4C4C_BC72_7BB2EB6D00E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dce9b44926cec7b39fa8722d3098b7fc96da8b3ed0321c2c305b88e2a891872f
#. default-sha256: 97f233cc35c01d6a8844ab7c3c3e74203166d9ce66fdecea5cc2f10cd2331026
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A1A2EF23_130D_4C4C_BC72_7BB2EB6D00E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though I don’t know what that something... ⟪k:1⟫might... ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫be..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どういう事情かは、⟪k:1⟫私には分かりませ、⟪k:2⟫ん、⟪k:3⟫……が……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7F25F21C_F8FC_41CB_B6C9_005B238CE407
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6d1f9daed40be69935e242e18ce3f361b07f56c193ebf7d79c33f442c36b387
#. default-sha256: 2fae30e048dc9fcad53a26ce54debeb492c2996f50f13892bdde0994d762d555
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7F25F21C_F8FC_41CB_B6C9_005B238CE407"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫When Michel’s eyes fell upon the White-Haired Girl "
"wrapped in that beam of light, he sputtered to a stop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫その時、⟪k:9⟫光に包まれる白い髪の娘を目にして――ミシェ"
"ルは声を失っていました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_61BB9077_43C2_47AA_A83A_8106A68E8A21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
